B3. Accessibility of media
Meaningful images have descriptive alt text
The test attendance preview describes the month and status counts. Decorative SVGs use aria-hidden="true";
controls retain text or accessible labels.
<img src="/attendance-preview.webp" width="390" height="844"
alt="Тестовый экран посещаемости: календарь за октябрь 2026 года
и счётчики — 0 присутствий, 1 пропуск, 0 опозданий,
1 запись без отметки.">
Motion follows the user’s preference
@media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {
*, *::before, *::after { animation: none !important;
transition: none !important; scroll-behavior: auto !important; } }
No speech media or sound playback: captions and sound equivalents are currently N/A.
